&lt;p&gt;Refer to the Supplier Manual for additional information on documentation requirements.&lt;&sol;p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Refer to the DME MAC web sites for additional bulletin articles and other publications related to this LCD.&lt;&sol;p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;POLICY SPECIFIC DOCUMENTATION REQUIREMENTS&lt;&sol;strong&gt;&lt;&sol;p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Items covered in this LCD have additional policy-specific requirements that must be met prior to Medicare reimbursement.&lt;&sol;p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Refer to the LCD-related Policy article, located at the bottom of this policy under the Related Local Coverage Documents section for additional information.&lt;&sol;p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;MISCELLANEOUS&lt;&sol;p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The&amp;#160;&lt;span style=&quot;line-height: 107%;&quot;&gt;treating practitioner &lt;&sol;span&gt;statement for beneficiaries on E0470 or E0471 devices must be kept on file by the supplier, but should not be sent in with the claim. This documentation must be available upon request.&lt;&sol;p&gt;
